The board includes USB-C, 3.3 V regulation, QSPI flash, 12 MHz crystal, BOOTSEL and RUN buttons, GP25 LED, and two 10-pin 2.54 mm breakout headers. I verified `routingDisabled` is not used.

Validation run:
- `bun run typecheck`: passed
